import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 944 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 10 | Myriad-Rank Republican Co-Construction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 944 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 10 | Myriad-Rank Republican Co-Construction","no":944,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 10","Myriad-Rank Republicanism","Co-Construction","Governance"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Advancement Basic Program","901-Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0944_模块5-规则十-万族共和共建.md","filePath":"en/0944_模块5-规则十-万族共和共建.md"}'),o={name:"en/0944_模块5-规则十-万族共和共建.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,d){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-944-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-10-myriad-rank-republican-co-construction" tabindex="-1">Entry 944 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 10 | Myriad-Rank Republican Co-Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-944-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-10-myriad-rank-republican-co-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 944 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 10 | Myriad-Rank Republican Co-Construction&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 05 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-civilization-is-no-one-s-private-enterprise-but-myriad-ranks-construction-site" tabindex="-1">Introduction: civilization is no one&#39;s private enterprise, but Myriad Ranks&#39; construction site <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-civilization-is-no-one-s-private-enterprise-but-myriad-ranks-construction-site" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: civilization is no one&#39;s private enterprise, but Myriad Ranks&#39; construction site&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 9 speaks of individual strong ones lifting Myriad Ranks; Rule 10 pulls the lens to the whole civilization — the entire Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s governance, construction, and rule revision are not decided behind closed doors by a few Transcended Ones on the Anchor Council, but through Myriad-Rank republican co-construction. The human race, alien beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, and consciousness-information clans — the five lineages — must all have seats, votes, and veto power at the four levels of legislation, administration, judiciary, and supervision. This is Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s key step from &quot;equal qualification&quot; toward &quot;shared governance.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms here constitute the governance framework: the republican axiom of Myriad Races is this rule&#39;s body; the collective-ascension axiom decides co-construction&#39;s direction is whole-system ascension, not sharing spoils; the anti-predation axiom negates &quot;the strong deciding for Myriad Ranks&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the co-construction process respect each clan&#39;s causality, not forcibly assimilate; the law-first axiom lets &quot;co-construction rules, seat allocation, voting procedures&quot; be nailed first by the charter and Heavenly-Dao rules, not hijacked by temporary majorities.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-layer-co-construction-structure" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three-Layer Co-Construction Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-layer-co-construction-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three-Layer Co-Construction Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Legislative co-construction</strong>: Anchor Council seats are evenly allocated by Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages and planes; all charter amendments and new Heavenly-Dao rules must pass Myriad-Rank representatives&#39; vote;</li><li><strong>Administrative co-construction</strong>: the Symbiotic Executive Committee&#39;s department heads are recommended by clans and publicly elected, with no single lineage long monopolizing;</li><li><strong>Judicial and supervisory co-construction</strong>: Symbiotic Court and Anchor Supervisory Committee jurors and investigators are randomly drawn from Myriad Ranks&#39; clans, including Youth Supremes and planet-consciousness representatives.</li></ol><p>Co-construction is not bickering over every matter: routine affairs are handled quickly per charter authorization; only major-direction issues trigger Myriad-Rank voting.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Civilizational-contract argument</strong>: the civilizational contract signed when Myriad-Rank republicanism was established is essentially &quot;sovereignty resides in Myriad Ranks&quot;; co-construction is this sovereignty&#39;s daily exercise;</li><li><strong>Pluralistic-wisdom argument</strong>: the five lineages each have unique understandings of cosmic laws (e.g., consciousness-information clans excel at data, planet consciousness at ecology); co-construction is closer to truth than single-clan decision;</li><li><strong>Anti-dictatorship argument</strong>: history repeatedly proves handing civilization&#39;s direction to a single strong one/clan eventually alienates into predation; co-governance is the only sustainable stable structure.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network provides Myriad-Rank representatives remote-attendance and anonymous/real-name dual-track voting interfaces;</li><li>Council agendas, voting records, and amendment drafts are network-wide public, all traceable;</li><li>A &quot;any agenda materially affecting some clan entitles that clan to speak&quot; principle is set: any topic substantively affecting some clan, that clan&#39;s representative has forced speech and delayed-vote rights;</li><li>Newly incorporated civilizations with insufficient co-construction capability receive &quot;lift-you-on-and-walk-a-stretch-along&quot; council coaching from established civilizations, not having their rights exercised on their behalf.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: council procedure oversights, some clan&#39;s representatives marginalized, correct within a time limit;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: manipulating votes, diluting some clan&#39;s seats, legislating behind closed doors, relevant resolutions automatically void, responsible persons&#39; post permissions frozen;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: under the name of &quot;efficiency&quot; canceling Myriad-Rank voting, moving toward single-clan dictatorship, launches charter defense under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure (connecting Entry 901&#39;s emergency charter-defense mechanism).</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s agenda-public system is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee checks seat allocation and voting authenticity as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates &quot;procedure-violating&quot; cases as the third layer; Myriad Ranks&#39; clans retain the original right to directly submit constitutional-amendment motions to the Anchor Council as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: avoiding single-clan decision-making&#39;s systematic blind spots; co-construction lets civilization detour less</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: negating &quot;the strong act on heaven&#39;s behalf,&quot; eradicating dictatorial-predation soil from governance structure; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type civilizations rely on Gu Chensha&#39;s personal will that words settle everything; Heng Yuan Zhou major resolutions require Myriad-Rank representatives&#39; vote, and a single clan may veto</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages, Youth Supremes, planet consciousness, and consciousness-information clans all have legislative seats</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated civilizations gain council seats upon access, seats automatically expand as civilization expands</li></ul><p>Myriad-Rank republican co-construction in actual operation must also solve a technical puzzle: Myriad Ranks speak different languages, perceive time differently, and have differing council habits. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s solution is the Alaya Network&#39;s &quot;cross-intent translation&quot; interface — clan representatives need not first learn each other&#39;s language; the network directly translates causal intent and value demands into forms the other side can understand. The council hall is thus not some clan&#39;s cultural showroom, but Myriad-Rank cultures&#39; convergence point. When a newly incorporated civilization&#39;s representative sits in council for the first time, what he feels is not being Sinicized or assimilated, but being seriously heard. Co-construction&#39;s quality ultimately depends on whether this hearing is real, long-term, and equal to every niche civilization.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank republican co-construction is civilizational finalization&#39;s political form. It ensures: no matter how laws evolve or how the worldview expands, the steering wheel always remains in Myriad Ranks&#39; own hands.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Ranks Co-Advancement Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.html">Entry 901 · Civilizational Final-Finalization Jurisprudential Basis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.html">Entry 943 · Rule 9 Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
